OL,3,GNEWSAUniversal will be 'a wake-up call'
OL,4,Afor theme parks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe arrival of Universal UK Resort and
OL,7,Ftheme park would be a "shake-up and
OL,8,Fwake-up call" to other parks in the UK,
OL,9,Fthe man behind some of the country's
OL,10,Ftop attractions said.
OL,12,FJohn Wardley, who has developed several
OL,13,Fparks and whose work includes Nemesis
OL,14,Fat Alton Towers, believed the planned
OL,15,Fattraction near Bedford would be "the
OL,16,Fbest thing to happen to the industry in
OL,17,FBritain in many years".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
