OL,3,GNEWSAUniversal will be 'a wake-up call'
OL,4,Afor theme parks
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is due to appear at a sell-out talk
OL,7,Fon Friday as part of the inaugural
OL,8,FWrite by the River Bedford Literacy
OL,9,FFestival, which runs from 18-20
OL,10,FSeptember.
OL,12,FHe said demand for his event had been
OL,13,Fso high it had been moved to a larger
OL,14,Fvenue at the University of Bedfordshire
OL,15,Ftheatre.
